{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721950/extras/Yorda_s_Quest_A_Lighthearted_Magic_Fantasy_RPG_Description_1_EN.png?t=1749388792\" /></div><br>The Demon Lord Veral has returned after being sealed away for 300 years... Legend tells of a hero who will come to save the world in its darkest hour, but there's just one problem: the world's been at peace for 300 years! Everyone forgot how to fight! And so, it's up to Yorda, a simple farmer with delusions of grandeur, to respond to the kingdom's call and rise up! Join him as he meets quirky characters and fights all manner of goofy monsters as he makes his way to becoming the hero of his dreams! From a farmer of crops to a farmer of EXP, Yorda departs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721950/extras/Yorda_s_Quest_A_Lighthearted_Magic_Fantasy_RPG_Description_2_EN.png?t=1749388792\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Embark on a light-hearted romp through a fantasy landscape! Explore roads, caves, mountains, ruins... and maybe even an active volcano! Gain moves from story events and build your party into one capable of taking on even the nastiest demons around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721950/extras/Yorda_s_Quest_A_Lighthearted_Magic_Fantasy_RPG_Description_3_EN.png?t=1749388792\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721950/extras/Yorda_s_Quest_A_Lighthearted_Magic_Fantasy_RPG_Description_01_EN.png?t=1749388792\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721950/extras/Yorda_s_Quest_A_Lighthearted_Magic_Fantasy_RPG_Description_02_EN.png?t=1749388792\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721950/extras/Yorda_s_Quest_A_Lighthearted_Magic_Fantasy_RPG_Description_03_EN.png?t=1749388792\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721950/extras/Yorda_s_Quest_A_Lighthearted_Magic_Fantasy_RPG_Description_4_EN.png?t=1749388792\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quick Turn-based Fantasy RPG Gameplay!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll have to be as quick as Yorda's own speed stat if you wanna survive in this world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Hilarious, Parody-Packed Script!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot fire at rocks! Curse the younger generations! Ponder loudly why you can't just hit up a weapons shop in each new town!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721950?t=1749388792","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721950?t=1749388792","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721950/8cd50aed8ba511d63720f5cfaa9388b0121b200a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749388792","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721950/8cd50aed8ba511d63720f5cfaa9388b0121b200a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749388792","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721950/extras/Yorda_s_Quest_A_Ligh